<!DOCTYPE params SYSTEM "../../../../src/libs/tgf/params.dtd">

<!--
	The Kuiper T81 is a surprisingly stable car for a machine of its
	class. Despite - or perhaps because of - its weight, the T81 is
	a very forgiving car.
-->

